{"id":"msg_m_subquest_1441_s","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_mirrorprincess","label":"Mirror Princess · Quest"},"label":"1. Prince.","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_subquest_1441_e","speakers":{"mirrorprincess":"Mirror Princess"},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_1","text":"Prince.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_2","text":"Are you seeing this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_3","text":"Who is this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_4","text":"Someone who desires to be the most beautiful.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_5","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_5","text":"Cinderella?","jump":"m_subquest_1441_s_7"},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_6","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_6","text":"Snow White?","jump":"m_subquest_1441_s_11"},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_7","text":"It is as I thought.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_8","text":"My Prince Charming will recognize me","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_9","text":"no matter what name I use.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_10","text":"I'm so touched.","jump":"m_subquest_1441_s_17"},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_11","text":"She is certainly a beautiful person,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_12","text":"but I'm not her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_13","text":"Don't you recognize me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_14","text":"Cinderella?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_15","text":"That's right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_16","text":"You finally recognized me.","jump":"m_subquest_1441_s_17"},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_17","text":"Why are you texting me with this name?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_18","text":"I was told that if I had a favor to ask of you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_19","text":"I should do it under a different name.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_20","text":"Like a masquerade.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_21","text":"Who told you that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_22","text":"Anis and Neon.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_23","text":"... Uh-huh.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_24","text":"Is there a problem?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_25","text":"No, there's no problem.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_26","text":"Okay, good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_27","text":"Anyway, what was it that you needed help with?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_28","text":"I've waited for a very long time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_29","text":"I don't think I can wait any longer.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_30","text":"What are you talking about?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_31","text":"It's been ages","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_32","text":"since I asked Anis and Neon to bring me a mirror,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_33","text":"but they haven't brought me","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_34","text":"a single one.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_35","text":"I imagine they must be somewhat difficult to obtain.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_36","text":"I realize that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_37","text":"but this is something I desperately require.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_38","text":"Maintaining my beauty is essential to me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_39","text":"So you're going to look for a mirror yourself?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_40","text":"That's right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_41","text":"I'm going to search the Crystal Region to see if there are any crystals which could be used as a mirror.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_42","text":"Absolutely not. It's far too dangerous.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_43","text":"I understand your concern.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_44","text":"You're anxious that I might accidently bring back the wrong type of crystal.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_45","text":"Don't worry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_46","text":"I know what kind of harm those can bring to us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_47","text":"I only intend to bring back a specific type of crystal.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_48","text":"Real ones.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_49","text":"Real crystals?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_50","text":"Yes. Real crystals that don't conduct electricity.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_51","text":"I was initially going to set out alone,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_52","text":"but I assume that would make your life rather difficult,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_53","text":"wouldn't it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_54","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_54","text":"It would.","jump":"m_subquest_1441_s_56"},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_55","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_55","text":"You'd be safe in assuming that, yes.","jump":"m_subquest_1441_s_56"},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_56","text":"So,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_57","text":"Prince,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_58","text":"I was hoping you could go with me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_59","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_59","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_60","text":"Thank you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1441_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"mirrorprincess","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1441_s_61","text":"I'll see you later, then.","jump":null}],"chat":true}